# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command counters
usage 1   counters on <space>           start tallying reads/writes/executes for <space>
usage 2   counters off                  stop tallying (kept counts stay readable)
usage 3   counters clear                zero every count, stay armed
usage 4   counters <addr> [<len>]       totals over a range, default length 1
usage 5   counters top [r|w|x|u] [<n>]  hottest addresses, default reads, default 20
usage 6   counters cold <addr> <len>    addresses in the range nothing ever touched

case on the fake target
target fake
covers 1-6
$ counters
out 48
Usage: counters on|off|clear|top|cold|<addr> ...
status 0
action none
$ counters top
out 47
Not counting - run `counters on <space>` first.
status 0
action none
$ counters on
out 26
Usage: counters on <space>
status 0
action none
$ counters on RAM
out 51
Counting reads/writes/executes for RAM (256 bytes).
status 0
action none
$ counters 10
out 95
RAM:
  RAM 0x10-0x10
  reads 0, writes 0, executes 0
  uninitialized reads 0, bytes touched 0/1
status 0
action none
$ counters 10 4
out 95
RAM:
  RAM 0x10-0x13
  reads 0, writes 0, executes 0
  uninitialized reads 0, bytes touched 0/4
status 0
action none
$ counters top
out 30
Nothing has been accessed yet.
status 0
action none
$ counters top w
out 30
Nothing has been accessed yet.
status 0
action none
$ counters top x 2
out 30
Nothing has been accessed yet.
status 0
action none
$ counters top u
out 30
Nothing has been accessed yet.
status 0
action none
$ counters top q
out 30
Unknown sort 'q'. Try r/w/x/u.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ counters cold
out 33
Usage: counters cold <addr> <len>
status 0
action none
$ counters cold 0 8
out 87
8 untouched address(es) in RAM 0x0-0x7:
  0x0
  0x1
  0x2
  0x3
  0x4
  0x5
  0x6
  0x7
status 0
action none
$ counters off
out 24
Access counting stopped.
status 0
action none
$ counters 10
out 114
RAM (counting stopped):
  RAM 0x10-0x10
  reads 0, writes 0, executes 0
  uninitialized reads 0, bytes touched 0/1
status 0
action none
$ counters clear
out 22
Access counts cleared.
status 0
action none
$ counters frob
out 78
Unknown 'counters' subcommand 'frob'. Try on/off/clear/top/cold or an address.
status 0
action none
$ counters on NOPE
out 83
Error: No memory space named 'NOPE'. Available: RAM, ROM, VRAM, IO, UNSIZED, CpuBus
status 1
action none
end

case a bare target
target bare
covers 1
$ counters on RAM
out 42
This core does not report access counters.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ counters
out 58
No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end

case counting on moonrt
target moonrt
covers 1-6
$ counters on RAM
out 42
This core does not report access counters.
status 1
action none
$ spaces
